    "description": "- Created new and enhanced existing public-facing REST endpoints to enable customers to create seamless authentication experiences for end users in both Java and Node.js\n- Built and maintained high-traffic end-user UIs in React to allow end users and admins to authenticate in a secure and frictionless manner through collaboration with designers and product managers\n- Designed and implemented Oauth2/OIDC compliant features to enable the platform to serve new use cases through collaboration with architects and product managers\n- Led squads to design and deliver features while coordinating with a distributed team, ensuring a consistent experience across the platform\n- Migrated an acquired product to the PingOne infrastructure by replacing the database layer, writing tests, and improving automation, improving developer velocity and confidence in deploying new features\n- Deployed and validated services in new regions and enabled new markets worldwide through configuration updates in AWS Terraform\n- Created documentation and trainings for developers on writing unit and integration tests, increasing test coverage by ten-fold across multiple services\n- Reduced platform-wide latency by over 50% by tuning Kafka and Cassandra configurations and redesigned the team's end-to-end testing suite\n- Designed a daily Jenkins job that reports code coverage and a Grafana dashboard to visualize the data, improving observability\n- Improved the team's on-call process by configuring real-time alerts on issues or abnormalities in critical services and user journeys\n- Reduced developer response time and provided high availability to customers by creating and maintaining service runbooks\n- Maintained 99.99% platform uptime by participating in on-call rotation to diagnose and fix production issues\n- Created public code samples for automating platform tasks using Python, reducing pressure on support for common customer requests",
